### DS напрямую: извлечение PDF
POST {{ds}}/financials/extract
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=AlphaHubBoundary

--AlphaHubBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="medium.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ../../ds/demo_pdfs/medium.pdf
--AlphaHubBoundary--
